# Swap to a postgresql:// URL for a real deployment; SQLite is the
# zero-config default for local dev.
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"

# openssl rand -base64 32
AUTH_SECRET="replace-me"

# Optional. Used by two features:
#
#  1. Modultest exercise generation (lib/exercises/generator.ts). With a key
#     set, each opgave is written fresh by Claude for the task type due next,
#     steering away from topics you have already had. Without it, the app
#     serves the hand-authored variant pool instead — everything still works,
#     there is just a finite amount of content.
#  2. Real OCR/vision extraction for report-card uploads. Without it,
#     lib/ocr.ts falls back to a manual-entry stub.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OCR_PROVIDER=anthropic
